From: RabbizOS experiments
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] egl/wayland: opt in to scanout allocations on Exynos kmsro

Source equivalent of the version-pinned EGL binary experiment. Not upstreamed
or built here. The kmsro primary-node fix is ALSO required: CREATE_DUMB cannot
run on the Exynos render node. See docs/a21s-qt-gpu-scanout.md.

--- a/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_wayland.c
+++ b/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_wayland.c
@@ -1332 +1332,4 @@ get_back_bo(struct dri2_egl_surface *dri2_surf,
    use_flags = __DRI_IMAGE_USE_SHARE | __DRI_IMAGE_USE_BACKBUFFER;
+
+   if (getenv("RABBIZ_EGL_SCANOUT"))
+      use_flags |= __DRI_IMAGE_USE_SCANOUT;
